{"id":"en_the-drifter-i-saved-was-a-dragon","title":"The Drifter I Saved Was a Dragon","titleEn":"The Drifter I Saved Was a Dragon","description":"Ivy, a Dragon Whisperer, pretends to be in a relationship with Damian as a way to escape an arranged marriage, while secretly pursuing the evil dragon she intends to hunt. What she does not know is that Damian is in fact the hidden Dragon Prince. His feelings for her become genuine and profound, and he is willing to sacrifice his own life so that she can succeed. Ivy rejects that outcome and instead reveals that the knights are the real villains. Though she loses her sight while saving the town, she goes on to live happily, guided always by the heartbeat of her dragon.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-drifter-i-saved-was-a-dragon/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-drifter-i-saved-was-a-dragon/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Superpower","Fantasy","Magic","Warrior","Counterattack","Comeback"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnqk4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-drifter-i-saved-was-a-dragon_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnqk4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-drifter-i-saved-was-a-dragon_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnqk4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-drifter-i-saved-was-a-dragon_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnqk4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-drifter-i-saved-was-a-dragon_4","title":"Episod